{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_grabds_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_grabds_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "旧梦重温",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_grabds_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ce624df1bce35fec249cc7b65a7a0be298dd956d77e2769b32c33cb5df864179",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "风很慢很慢地吹过来，吹到身上的时候，就像个调皮的小朋友一样摇你的袖子。\n它带来很多新奇的气味跟你分享：油菜籽被榨出金色的油，稻秸被扎成捆摞在一起，米粒在锅里翻滚出热气......\n于是你就知道了这片田野里正在发生的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姐姐说，她这趟从大荒城来罗德岛时，就经过了这样一片田野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是麦田吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不光是麦田。还有稻子、高粱和野草。好多我叫不上来名字的花花草草，都长得好高好高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从这片田野中，伸出一条窄窄的土路来。刚下过雨，地上全是烦人的泥坑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，小满，不要下雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，那就换成晴天好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晴天，小虫子和小羽兽也会开心，叽叽喳喳地叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，太阳把草地晒得暖烘烘的，那些耐不住热的小虫子，全都躲到路边的树荫里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样的天气，好舒服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是不是已经想打个盹了？别忘了你们答应我的哦，听完这个故事，就要乖乖去睡觉了。医生们也说过了，一定要保证充足的睡眠才行哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满小满，那你呢，你不去睡吗？你还要等黍姐姐吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她今天有好多事要做，肯定不会来了。等你们睡着了，我也会赶紧休息的，我可不想把自己拖成重感冒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满小满，你接着讲呀——我们保证会听话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这时候，从远处跑来一辆车子，车斗里装满了刚收下来的粮食，顶上还盖着一层厚厚的稻草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么要盖一层稻草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为驾驶这辆车的年轻农夫，急着将粮食运送到粮站去。他担心粮食在路上被雨淋了，就给粮食盖上一层稻草被子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是他还是很担忧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这大晴天的，怎么总是有朵乌云跟着我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，我得再开快点儿，要是雨落下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出什么事了？小满......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别怕，没人受伤。只是他刚转过拐角，就发现前面的路被堵住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！这牧兽和驮兽是谁家的，快来人把它们牵走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没人理他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他走近一看，驮兽的脖子上没有缰绳，耳朵上也没有钉标签。牧兽倒是套着鞍具，但他再怎么使劲也拽不动这头牧兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "头顶的乌云越来越近，年轻的农夫急得挠头。他忽然有了主意，到车斗里抓出一把稻草......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给，好吃的！过来就给你吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘬嘬嘬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的驮兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "动物也不搭理他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们为什么要挡在路上不走呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么办？！要是下雨了我这一车粮就全报销了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，这不会是什么劫道的套路吧？难道树荫里还躲着人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快走呀！吁！驾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我车里好像有条鞭子，以前在草甸子里拿来开路用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的农夫取出鞭子，犹豫着。驮兽和牧兽安静地看着他，没有害怕，也没有动。\n乌云慢慢飘过来。\n鞭子被高高举起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快住手！我有办法把他们弄走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满！你怎么跑到故事里去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是我，这只是一个恰巧路过的小姑娘，嗯！我只是......扮演一下她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么乖巧的牧兽，这么安分的驮兽，怎么忍心用鞭子抽他们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你说，你有什么办法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这简单，让我来劝劝他们，这种事情我可有经验了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能跟动物说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那当然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恰巧路过的小姑娘走到拦路的动物身边，忽地凑近，仔细聆听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你这小孩——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你听出什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......什么都没听到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我听不懂他们说话了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂喂，小满——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你耍赖！怎么讲故事还把自己也讲进去了？你又不在那里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都说了那不是我，是个碰巧路过的小姑娘而已。我猜呀，她应该是附近的学生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你说，她叫什么名字？黍姐姐给你讲的时候，也有这个人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......问题真多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你现在不也进故事里面来了？那你又是什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是一棵树！看，哗啦啦！朝你头上撒叶子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满小满，你真的能听懂动物说话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然是真的。我以前给你们讲了那么多故事，总不能都是我一个人编出来的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，故事里那个刚好路过的姐姐，她也能听懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有......我也能听懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个嘛，我倒是问过许多人，黍姐姐，笨水牛，还有博士......答案嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满怀期待的孩子们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，只要有心，就能听懂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽说，有些动物脾气很倔，一开始不愿意和人交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但只要弄清楚他们想做什么，就能听懂他们在说什么了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弄清楚它们想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真别和我开玩笑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我这一车粮食都是大荒城培育出的新品种，要是泡了雨，粮站的老头会扒了我的皮的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城，大荒城？对呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看这只牧兽脖子上挂的号牌！这是一只从大荒城来的牧兽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像......还真是。大荒城离这儿可远了，它是怎么跑到这里来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，我认得你。我记得你那时怀孕了，跟在一群牧兽的最后面，慢悠悠地吃草晒太阳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的身上，怎么有了这么多伤口......你的孩子呢？走丢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "牧兽低下了头。沉默的驮兽朝她挪近了一步，他们依偎在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，是来找你们的孩子的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别担心，我会帮你一起找的。你能告诉我那是个什么样的孩子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它是个善良的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "听故事的孩子们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的说话了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它的眼睛很大，很圆，我们就叫它圆圆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大多数时间，它不哭也不闹，紧紧跟着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它的腿发抖，但还是一步一步跟上来。它是个很坚强的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圆圆和你们......长得像吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很像。但用你们的眼睛来看的话，一点儿也不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它是那么小，那么讨人喜欢......它坐在我们的肩上时，总是轻轻地用爪子扣着肩头，它不想弄疼我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，可是，那孩子是怎么走丢的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不怪它......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不得不离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "离开大荒城？为什么呢？如果是为了寻找口感更新鲜的牧草，跑到河岸边也就够了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们沿着路一直走。有的山上和河流里没有路，我们就踩在石头上踏过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们的孩子，它在路上跟丢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的驮兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以现在是要找到那个幼崽，你们才肯挪窝是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是从大荒城一直到这儿，这么远的路，要找多久才能找完？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们看那朵乌云，说不定什么时候雨就哗啦啦淋下来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是也说句话呀，小姑娘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们......能不能先把路让开，让他过去？我可以留下来帮你们找孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不能。这是出于另外的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那只驮兽，为什么一直不说话？他不也是来找孩子的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同样的原因......你还没弄清的原因。所以它还不会和你说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的农夫蹲在地上，歪着脑袋看向那朵越来越低的乌云。阴影罩着树木、道路、驮兽、牧兽和人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，你们已经困了吗？要不今天先讲到这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才不要！我就是听入神了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘，小声点，那边的弟弟妹妹们刚睡着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满，你悄悄告诉我好不好？那个走丢的孩子，会是什么样子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把我带到罗德岛的医生姐姐说，我的眼睛随我妈妈......那只幼崽也会长得像它的爸爸妈妈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "牧兽都能说人话了，那它生的孩子长什么样子都有可能——反正是在讲故事啦，不要管那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就要管！就要管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘——你们还想不想听后面的故事啦？我保证，你们一会儿就知道那只幼崽长什么样子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在那自言自语什么呢？你不是说你有办法搞定吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我正在想办法呀。按理说，她就是这时候出现的......再等等好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等什么？这老天下雨可不等人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是没办法，我还是去拿鞭子......实在对不住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她来了，等到了！你看那边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从路的那头，走来一位神仙。\n她手中捏着几棵稗子，裤脚上似乎还沾着些泥点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们是要往粮站去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，对！眼看就要下雨了，我得赶紧走，可神仙你看，这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说那朵乌云吗？别担心，雨落不下来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也不必着急赶路了......前面的路已经塌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路塌了？怎么回事，这季节又没有山洪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以更难提防。许是前几年山体开裂的旧伤，到今天终于撑不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你们拦在这里，倒是救了他一命呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们......知道前面的路会塌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是另外一个原因？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一部分。我们要帮的人不止他一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的驮兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错。既然你们已经知道了前路的危险，我们该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一等！我不是已经弄清另一个原因了吗？为什么他还是不肯和我说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拦路的牧兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有的话不必说，也能听懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们......这就走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "农夫一拍脑袋，钻进车斗里抓出一大把粮食，朝着驮兽和牧兽追过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一等！谢谢你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——呼，为什么，它们看着走得很慢，我却追不上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走了就追不上了，世事如此，不必遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，那朵乌云也散去了。我没骗你吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "乌云消失无踪，阳光填补了空缺。\n年轻的农夫撑着膝盖气喘吁吁，手里的粮食抓得很紧，没有漏下一颗。\n忽然，从车斗里传来一阵急促的声响。一只小兽探出脑袋，随后腾的一下跳出车斗，像一朵乌云。\n它似乎刚睡醒，下意识地从身上抖落一大把杂乱的稻草，完全没弄清自己是怎么到这里来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我闻到了爸爸妈妈的味道！它们在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小乌云兽绕着车子转了好几圈，好几次跳起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈呢？这是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......圆圆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认识我？不对，你很面熟，我见过你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你为什么会在车斗里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不知道，我就是趁着太阳很好，在稻草堆里睡了一觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一觉醒来，爸爸妈妈就不见了！可我明明闻到了它们的味道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们刚刚的确在这里！还没走远，你看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的爸爸妈妈呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我认不出，我只记得......它们的气味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "认不出？你怎么会认不出来呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的眼睛这么圆，就和那只牧兽一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不记得了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是他们还记得......他们说你小时候不哭也不闹，总是跟在爸爸妈妈后面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们说你连路也走不稳，却还是一步一步坚持往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们说你坐在他们的肩膀上，总是轻轻地用爪子扣着肩头，怕弄疼爸爸妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我......这就是我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小乌云兽急得原地转圈，几乎要哭出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我很多年没见过它们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边，你看！那就是你的爸爸妈妈——我带你去找他们，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "乌云兽跳进小满的怀里。小满吸吸鼻子，朝着火烧云下面的驮兽与牧兽跑去。\n她一边跑，一边朝他们喊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我找到你们的孩子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉默的驮兽似乎听到了她的喊叫，于是停下脚步，转过身等待着。\n小满加快脚步，想要将小乌云兽带到驮兽面前。\n可无论她怎么咬牙使劲，她与那只驮兽之间的距离始终没有缩短。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没、没用的，你追不上它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的乌云兽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们已经......走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可那只驮兽，明明就站在那里，一直没有离开。\n小满没有力气了，她不得不停下来大口喘气。夕阳下每个人的影子都是那么细那么长，像几条永远不会消失的墨痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会把圆圆送到她的爸爸妈妈面前，我会让圆圆能认出她的爸爸妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，真的是神仙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪里有什么神仙，我们都一样，不过是有心的人罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说对吗，恰好路过的小姑娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有心......有心就能听见，就能认出来，是这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，圆圆就交给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的神仙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心吧，我保证......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么回来了？那个幼崽呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交给那位神仙了，她一定会将圆圆送到爸爸妈妈身边的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "话说......我可以搭你的车吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以啊，你要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正雨落不下来，我也不必赶时间了。我现在打算往回走，换另一条路去粮站。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的小姑娘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我也去粮站！后面再想别的办法去大荒城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的农夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城，大荒城可远了。说不定路上，你还会再遇到那两只牧兽和驮兽呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "路过的小姑娘翻身跳进车斗，摔进厚厚的稻草里面。她头枕着胳膊，注视起天上的云霞来。\n车辆启动，风吹起来，稻草搔在脸蛋上，痒痒的，但她并不介意。\n被太阳晒得暖烘烘的稻草，就像牧兽秋后的毛，轻柔地将女孩拥在怀中。\n女孩感觉自己就像睡在牧兽背上......牧兽，还是驮兽，还是乌云兽？\n呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经睡着了吗，小满？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神仙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "被子怎么又掉了。要记得盖好被子呀，这样才会快点好起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈呀......你们要......认得我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小满又长高了些，这床被子都快盖不住你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睡吧，小满，做个好梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梦醒之前，我会一直在这里陪着你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
